1
00:00:00,442 --> 00:00:03,072
[MOCKING PENNY]
"It doesn't matter if you're cool or not.

2
00:00:03,236 --> 00:00:06,366
Because I'm Penny, I'm pretty
and I can do whatever I want."

3
00:00:06,531 --> 00:00:10,201
[NORMAL VOICE] "You think you're doing
a favor by being in a relationship with me."

4
00:00:10,368 --> 00:00:13,578
[MOCKING PENNY] "No. I'm doing you
a favor by being in the same room as you."

5
00:00:13,747 --> 00:00:15,127
Leonard, stop the car.

6
00:00:16,583 --> 00:00:17,623
(Penny:)What?

7
00:00:17,792 --> 00:00:20,252
(Sheldon:)I can't listen to the two of you fight
anymore.

8
00:00:25,258 --> 00:00:28,008
(Sheldon:)-Come on. We're late.
-Calm down. We'll make the movie.

9
00:00:28,178 --> 00:00:31,968
(Sheldon:)I believe my alarm is appropriate.
The movie starts in 17 minutes.

10
00:00:32,140 --> 00:00:34,810
(Sheldon:)We'll need to make all the lights
on Colorado Boulevard.

11
00:00:34,976 --> 00:00:37,896
(Sheldon:)Plus, skip the concession stand
and pre-show urination.

12
00:00:38,813 --> 00:00:43,523
(Raj:)Oh, dude, I wish you had said something
before I pounded that last Red Bull.

13
00:00:43,693 --> 00:00:46,363
SHELDON:
Go. Go, Power Rangers, go.

14
00:00:48,656 --> 00:00:50,746
(Penny:)-Hey.
-Hey.

15
00:00:50,909 --> 00:00:53,789
(Leonard:)-We're, uh, going to the movies.
-No, we're not.

16
00:00:55,038 --> 00:00:59,018
(Sheldon:)We're standing in the hallway,
suffering through an awkward encounter.

